1. Hardware — CERN-OHL-S-2.0 (CERN Open Hardware Licence v2, Strongly Reciprocal)
   The design of the arm and the test rigs: CAD sources and exports (test1/cad/,
   test1/out/cad/), drawings (test1/out/drawings/), dimensions and parameters
   (test1/params.py), bills of materials and order lists, sketches, and the
   documentation describing the design (goal.md, docs/, test1/README.md, test1/docs/).
   Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt

2. Software — GPL-3.0-or-later (GNU General Public License v3 or later)
   All program code: firmware (test1/firmware/), PC tools (test1/host/), simulation
   (test1/sim/), tests (test1/tests/), and the helper scripts (test1/*.py except
   params.py, tools/).
   Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

When in doubt about a file: design and documentation fall under CERN-OHL-S-2.0,
executable code under GPL-3.0-or-later.

No warranty is given. Working with compressed air is dangerous; read the safety
instructions in test1/docs/manual.md.
